{
  "fps": 30,
  "label": "IBN AL-QAYYIM",
  "tagPrefix": "SAYINGS",
  "cadence": 3,
  "reels": [
    {
      "id": "01-scattering",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "In the heart there is a *scattering*",
          "motif": "rosette"
        },
        {
          "text": "that only turning to Allah can *gather.*",
          "motif": "crescent"
        },
        {
          "text": "A loneliness only His *company* removes.",
          "motif": "lamp"
        },
        {
          "text": "A sadness only knowing Him can *lift.*",
          "motif": "sun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A restlessness only running to Him can *calm.*",
          "motif": "boat"
        },
        {
          "text": "A need only His *love* can fill.",
          "motif": "hearts"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "مدارج السالكين",
        "en": "Madarij al-Salikin"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "02-between",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "You are always *between* two things:",
          "motif": "halves"
        },
        {
          "text": "a blessing from Allah that needs your *gratitude,*",
          "motif": "tree"
        },
        {
          "text": "and a sin of yours that needs His *forgiveness.*",
          "motif": "drop"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gratitude and *istighfar:*",
          "motif": "rosette"
        },
        {
          "text": "two habits for every *day.*",
          "motif": "hourglass"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الوابل الصيب",
        "en": "Al-Wabil al-Sayyib"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "03-glass",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Don't let your heart be a *sponge.*",
          "motif": "drop"
        },
        {
          "text": "His teacher, Ibn Taymiyyah, told him:",
          "motif": "book"
        },
        {
          "text": "a sponge soaks up every *doubt* it meets.",
          "motif": "mountain"
        },
        {
          "text": "Make your heart like solid *glass.*",
          "motif": "lamp"
        },
        {
          "text": "Doubts pass by. It sees them *clearly,*",
          "motif": "sun"
        },
        {
          "text": "and pushes them *away.*",
          "motif": "boat"
        },
        {
          "text": "No advice, he said, helped him *more.*",
          "motif": "rosette"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "مفتاح دار السعادة",
        "en": "Miftah Dar al-Sa'adah"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "04-seek",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Where is your *heart?*",
          "motif": "hearts"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for it when you hear the *Quran.*",
          "motif": "book"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for it in gatherings of *dhikr.*",
          "motif": "rosette"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for it when you're *alone* with Him.",
          "motif": "crescent"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not there? Ask Allah to give you a *heart,*",
          "motif": "door"
        },
        {
          "text": "for you have *none.*",
          "motif": "hourglass"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الفوائد",
        "en": "Al-Fawa'id"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "05-wounds",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Sins are *wounds.*",
          "motif": "mountain"
        },
        {
          "text": "And many a wound lands where it *kills.*",
          "motif": "hourglass"
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't wait for the *last* one.",
          "motif": "candle"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn back while there is *time.*",
          "motif": "sun"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الجواب الكافي",
        "en": "Al-Jawab al-Kafi"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "06-dua",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Du'a is a *medicine.*",
          "motif": "drop"
        },
        {
          "text": "One of the most *beneficial* of all.",
          "motif": "tree"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is the *enemy* of affliction.",
          "motif": "mountain"
        },
        {
          "text": "It pushes it back and *treats* it.",
          "motif": "boat"
        },
        {
          "text": "It stops it from *coming down,*",
          "motif": "crescent"
        },
        {
          "text": "or lifts or *lightens* it when it does.",
          "motif": "sun"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الجواب الكافي",
        "en": "Al-Jawab al-Kafi"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "07-half",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Your religion has two *halves.*",
          "motif": "halves"
        },
        {
          "text": "Half is relying on *Allah.*",
          "motif": "bird"
        },
        {
          "text": "Half is turning back to *Him.*",
          "motif": "door"
        },
        {
          "text": "Relying on Him is asking His *help.*",
          "motif": "lamp"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turning to Him is *worship.*",
          "motif": "arch"
        },
        {
          "text": "You alone we worship, You alone we ask for *help.*",
          "motif": "book"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "مدارج السالكين",
        "en": "Madarij al-Salikin"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "08-character",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "The religion is all *character.*",
          "motif": "rosette"
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever surpasses you in *character*",
          "motif": "tree"
        },
        {
          "text": "surpasses you in *religion.*",
          "motif": "hearts"
        },
        {
          "text": "So how do you *treat* people?",
          "motif": "sun"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "مدارج السالكين",
        "en": "Madarij al-Salikin"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09-hardness",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "Is your heart *hard?*",
          "motif": "mountain"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is a hardness in the heart",
          "motif": "door"
        },
        {
          "text": "that only remembering Allah can *melt.*",
          "motif": "candle"
        },
        {
          "text": "So treat it with *dhikr.*",
          "motif": "drop"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الوابل الصيب",
        "en": "Al-Wabil al-Sayyib"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10-rich",
      "cards": [
        {
          "text": "When people feel rich with the *world,*",
          "motif": "tree"
        },
        {
          "text": "be rich with *Allah.*",
          "motif": "crescent"
        },
        {
          "text": "When they find their joy in the *world,*",
          "motif": "mountain"
        },
        {
          "text": "find your joy in *Allah.*",
          "motif": "sun"
        },
        {
          "text": "When they find comfort in their *loved ones,*",
          "motif": "hearts"
        },
        {
          "text": "find your comfort in *Allah.*",
          "motif": "lamp"
        }
      ],
      "book": {
        "ar": "الفوائد",
        "en": "Al-Fawa'id"
      }
    }
  ]
}
